# YourWalk — sync (light)

Same **trigger words** as CrowdSpot / CrashDash / FME. Different **sources**: specs and methodology live in **this repo**; Notion is for grant/stakeholder status only.

CrowdLab guardrails: `~/.cursor/crowdlab/conventions.md`

## Why repo-first (not like Find My Electorate)

| | Find My Electorate | YourWalk |
|--|-------------------|----------|
| Spec SoT | Notion Phase 2 PRD | **`docs/PRD.md`** + companion docs |
| Methodology | In PRD / tech planning | **`docs/VULNERABILITY_INDEX.md` v1.1** (gate) |
| Backlog | Shared Notion Dev backlog | **`docs/BACKLOG.md`** |
| Notion role | Read spec, write progress | **Status mirror only** — link to repo paths |

Monash methodology + grant delivery evolve in git; do not duplicate or overwrite that prose in Notion.

