## Repo pull-spec stack (canonical)

| Trigger alias | Read (in order) |
|---------------|-----------------|
| **`pull spec`** (default) | `docs/VULNERABILITY_INDEX.md` → `docs/PRD.md` (scope + open questions) → `docs/BACKLOG.md` (Now) → `docs/DELIVERY_PLAN.md` (current sprint) |
| **`pull spec methodology`** | `docs/VULNERABILITY_INDEX.md` only |
| **`pull spec prd`** | `docs/PRD.md` + `docs/PHASES.md` |
| **`pull spec backlog`** | `docs/BACKLOG.md` |
| **`pull spec pipeline`** | `pipeline/README.md` + `docs/DATA_SET_REGISTER.md` |

Before ingestion or scoring code: methodology gate is **mandatory** (v1.1, not v0.2).

## Session state

After **pull spec**, write `.cursor/notion-session.json`:

```json
{
  "lastPullSpecAt": "ISO-8601",
  "lastPullSpecLabel": "default|methodology|prd|backlog|pipeline",
  "lastPullSpecSources": ["docs/VULNERABILITY_INDEX.md", "docs/PRD.md"]
}
```

Gitignore this file. Do not commit.

